Source: unbound-apt-source
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Mikael Hug <mikaelhug@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: unbound-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenPGP key of the Unbound APT repository
 The key that signs the Unbound APT repository at
 https://unbound-linux.github.io/apt, and an APT pin that allows the
 repository to provide only Unbound's own packages and its Apple kernels.

Package: unbound-apt-source
Architecture: all
Depends: unbound-archive-keyring, ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: unbound-apt-source-testing
Replaces: unbound-apt-source-testing
Description: Unbound APT repository
 Makes APT follow the rolling suite of the Unbound APT repository, which
 carries every Unbound release, built for Debian testing. Its
 main component holds the Unbound desktop and unbound-os, and its apple
 component the kernel and boot packages for Apple Silicon Macs.
